		(property "Design notes" "Local sampler module/header. Pin39 VSYS=isolated5V; on-board3V3_OUT isPICO_3V3 and must NOT parallel coreP3V3_CH. VBUS40,3V3_EN37 andADC_VREF35 unconnected. No USB/SWD/ground cable to a host during isolated operation; use isolated UART for runtime. Installed KiCad common THT footprint is the socketed prototype candidate; verify module orientation and clearance."
